---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-kent-blue">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last Updated: October 2024</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-justify">
      <p>At <strong>24x7 RO Support</strong>, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you use our website or book our services.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you book a service, we may collect the following information:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>Name</li>
          <li>Mobile Number</li>
          <li>Full Address & Pin Code</li>
          <li>RO Brand and Issue Details</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information solely for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li>To dispatch a technician to your location.</li>
          <li>To contact you regarding your booking.</li>
          <li>To provide customer support and process warranty claims.</li>
          <li>To send occasional service reminders (you can opt out anytime).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Data Sharing & Security</h2>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. Your data is shared only with our assigned technicians for the purpose of fulfilling your service request. We implement standard security measures to protect your data.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our website may contain links to third-party sites (like WhatsApp). We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-semibold">Email: support@24x7rosupport.com</p>
        <p class="font-semibold">Phone: 08062180546</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>